{
  "meta": {
    "is_partial": true,
    "description": "상품 그리드 + 페이지네이션 (products 데이터소스 사용, route.path 기반 navigate)"
  },
  "type": "basic",
  "name": "Div",
  "children": [
    {
      "comment": "제품 정보 중심 상품 리스트",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "props": {
        "className": "mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "iteration": {
            "source": "{{products?.data?.data ?? []}}",
            "item_var": "product"
          },
          "props": {
            "className": "flex flex-wrap md:flex-nowrap items-start gap-3 md:gap-4 px-3 py-3 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/40 transition-colors"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Button",
              "props": {
                "className": "relative w-32 h-32 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700"
              },
              "actions": [
                {
                  "type": "click",
                  "handler": "navigate",
                  "params": { "path": "{{(_global.shopBase ?? '/shop') + '/products/' + product.product_code}}" }
                }
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Img",
                  "props": {
                    "src": "{{product.thumbnail_url}}",
                    "alt": "{{product.name_localized ?? product.name}}",
                    "className": "w-full h-full object-cover"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Span",
                  "if": "{{Number(product.discount_rate ?? 0) > 0}}",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "absolute left-1 top-1 rounded bg-red-500 px-1 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold leading-none text-white"
                  },
                  "text": "{{product.discount_rate + '%'}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Div",
              "props": { "className": "flex-1 min-w-0" },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "props": { "className": "text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" },
                  "text": "{{product.brand_name ?? ''}}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Button",
                  "props": { "className": "block text-left text-sm md:text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:underline line-clamp-1" },
                  "text": "{{product.name_localized ?? product.name}}",
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "type": "click",
                      "handler": "navigate",
                      "params": { "path": "{{(_global.shopBase ?? '/shop') + '/products/' + product.product_code}}" }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "props": { "className": "mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" },
                  "children": [
                    { "type": "basic", "name": "Icon", "props": { "name": "star", "className": "text-amber-400" } },
                    { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "{{Number(product.rating_avg ?? 0).toFixed(1)}}" },
                    { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "text": "{{'(' + (product.review_count ?? 0) + ')'}}" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "if": "{{(product.summary_specs ?? []).length > 0}}",
                  "props": { "className": "mt-2 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 gap-y-0.5" },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "Div",
                      "iteration": { "source": "{{product.summary_specs ?? []}}", "item_var": "summary" },
                      "props": { "className": "flex min-w-0 text-xs leading-4" },
                      "children": [
                        { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "props": { "className": "w-16 md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" }, "text": "{{summary.label}}" },
                        { "type": "basic", "name": "Span", "props": { "className": "min-w-0 truncate font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200" }, "text": "{{summary.value}}" }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "P",
                  "if": "{{(product.summary_specs ?? []).length === 0}}",
                  "props": { "className": "mt-2 text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500" },
                  "text": "$t:lusento-catalog.catalog.list.no_summary"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "basic", "name": "Div",
              "props": { "className": "w-full md:w-1/4 flex-shrink-0 md:border-l md:border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 md:pl-4 flex items-center justify-end gap-3" },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "basic", "name": "Div", "props": { "className": "text-right" }, "children": [
                    { "type": "basic", "name": "Div", "if": "{{Number(product.list_price ?? 0) > Number(product.selling_price ?? 0)}}", "props": { "className": "text-xs text-gray-400 line-through" }, "text": "{{product.multi_currency_list_price?.[_global.preferredCurrency ?? _global.defaultCurrency]?.formatted ?? product.list_price_formatted}}" },
                    { "type": "basic", "name": "Div", "props": { "className": "text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white" }, "text": "{{product.multi_currency_selling_price?.[_global.preferredCurrency ?? _global.defaultCurrency]?.formatted ?? product.selling_price_formatted}}" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "basic", "name": "Div", "props": { "className": "flex flex-shrink-0" }, "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "basic", "name": "Button", "if": "{{catalog_filters?.data?.is_leaf === true}}",
                      "props": {
                        "disabled": "{{(_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).length >= 4 && !(_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).some(item => item.product_code === product.product_code)}}",
                        "className": "whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-xs font-medium border {{(_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).some(item => item.product_code === product.product_code) ? 'bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 border-gray-900 dark:border-white' : ((_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).length >= 4 ? 'bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 cursor-not-allowed' : 'bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 hover:border-gray-600')}}"
                      },
                      "text": "{{(_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).some(item => item.product_code === product.product_code) ? $t('lusento-catalog.catalog.compare.selected') : $t('lusento-catalog.catalog.compare.select')}}",
                      "actions": [{
                        "type": "click", "handler": "setState", "params": {
                          "target": "global",
                          "catalogCompareProducts": "{{(_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).some(item => item.product_code === product.product_code) ? (_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).filter(item => item.product_code !== product.product_code) : ((_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []).length < 4 ? [...(_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []), product] : (_global.catalogCompareProducts ?? []))}}"
                        }
                      }]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "빈 상태",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{(products?.data?.data ?? []).length === 0}}",
      "props": {
        "className": "flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 px-4 my-16"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "props": {
            "className": "w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Icon",
              "props": {
                "name": "search",
                "size": "2x",
                "className": "text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": {
            "className": "text-lg font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-1"
          },
          "text": "$t:shop.no_products"
        },
        {
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "P",
          "props": {
            "className": "text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
          },
          "text": "$t:shop.no_search_results"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "페이지네이션 — 총 건수가 상한에 걸리면 last_page 가 null 로 온다. 그때 last_page 만 보고 판단하면 페이저가 통째로 사라져 1페이지 밖 상품에 도달할 방법이 없어지므로, has_more_pages 와 현재 페이지도 함께 본다",
      "type": "basic",
      "name": "Div",
      "if": "{{((products?.data?.pagination?.last_page ?? 0) > 1) || (products?.data?.pagination?.has_more_pages ?? false) || ((products?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1) > 1)}}",
      "props": {
        "className": "flex justify-center items-center gap-2 mb-12"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "comment": "이전 페이지 버튼",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Button",
          "props": {
            "className": "p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg {{(products?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1) <= 1 ? 'opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed' : 'hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 cursor-pointer'}}",
            "disabled": "{{(products?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1) <= 1}}"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Icon",
              "props": {
                "name": "chevron-left",
                "className": "text-base"
              }
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "click",
              "handler": "navigate",
              "params": {
                "path": "{{route.path}}",
                "mergeQuery": true,
                "query": {
                  "page": "{{(products?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1) - 1}}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "페이지 번호 표시 — 마지막 페이지를 모를 때(총 건수 상한 초과) 1 로 채우면 '1 / 1' 로 굳어 끝난 것처럼 보인다. 그때는 현재 페이지만 표기한다",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Span",
          "props": {
            "className": "px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
          },
          "text": "{{products?.data?.pagination?.last_page ? ((products?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1) + ' / ' + products.data.pagination.last_page) : (products?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1)}}"
        },
        {
          "comment": "다음 페이지 버튼 — 이동 가능 여부는 총 건수와 무관하게 has_more_pages 가 정확히 말해 준다. last_page 로 판정하면 그 값이 null 인 목록에서 첫 페이지부터 비활성이 된다",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Button",
          "props": {
            "className": "p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg {{(products?.data?.pagination?.has_more_pages ?? false) ? 'hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 cursor-pointer' : 'opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed'}}",
            "disabled": "{{!(products?.data?.pagination?.has_more_pages ?? false)}}"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "basic",
              "name": "Icon",
              "props": {
                "name": "chevron-right",
                "className": "text-base"
              }
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "click",
              "handler": "navigate",
              "params": {
                "path": "{{route.path}}",
                "mergeQuery": true,
                "query": {
                  "page": "{{(products?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1) + 1}}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
